 n.º 2, of Portaria n.º 1563/2007","kind":"official","verifiedAt":"2026-11-20","machineReadableUrl":"https://files.diariodarepublica.pt/1s/2022/09/19000/0002800097.pdf"},{"id":"lei-7-2001","url":"https://diariodarepublica.pt/dr/detalhe/lei/23-2010-343919","title":"Lei n.º 7/2001, articles 1.º, n.º 2, and 2.º, a): a de facto union is two people living as spouses do for more than two years; it grounds no right while either is under 18 when it is recognized","kind":"official","verifiedAt":"2026-11-20","machineReadableUrl":"https://files.diariodarepublica.pt/1s/2010/08/16800/0376403768.pdf"},{"id":"portaria-91-2025","url":"https://diariodarepublica.pt/dr/detalhe/portaria/91-2025-910130846","title":"Portaria n.º 91/2025/1, article 2.º: EUR 110 for processing a national visa application (article 15.º, n.º 4, of the table of consular fees), in force from 2025-03-11","kind":"official","verifiedAt":"2026-11-20","machineReadableUrl":"https://files.diariodarepublica.pt/1s/2025/03/04800/0000900017.pdf"},{"id":"portaria-229-2021","url":"https://diariodarepublica.pt/dr/detalhe/portaria/434-2023-230006497","title":"Portaria n.º 229/2021 (table of consular fees), article 22.º, n.º 1: children up to the age of 6 pay no visa fee, and those from 6 and under 18 may be exempted","kind":"official","verifiedAt":"2026-11-20","machineReadableUrl":"https://files.diariodarepublica.pt/1s/2023/12/23900/0001200027.pdf"}],"countries":{"id":"countries","number":1},"formerCountries":{"id":"former-countries","number":1},"officialDomains":[{"id":"pt","number":1}],"countrySets":[{"id":"eu-free-movement","number":2}],"leapDayBirthday":"unsettled","requirements":[{"id":"remote-income","title":"Average monthly income from work over the last three months of at least four times the 2026 minimum wage (EUR 3,680)","expression":{"op":"gte","left":{"op":"fact","key":"principal.monthlyActiveIncome"},"right":{"op":"mul","operand":{"op":"money","amount":92000,"currency":"EUR"},"by":"4"}},"sources":["dr-84-2007-in